WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.480
EPISODE 9

01:43.480 --> 01:45.760
Sister, have some more porridge.

01:46.520 --> 01:48.200
Thank you. Sorry for the trouble.

01:48.280 --> 01:49.680
Not at all.

01:54.320 --> 01:55.280
Madam.

01:55.360 --> 01:58.360
Master Du has returned. He's outside.

01:59.280 --> 02:00.760
Quick. Invite him in.

02:01.800 --> 02:03.160
Alas.

02:10.480 --> 02:12.360
- I'll excuse myself now.
- I'll excuse myself now.

02:26.160 --> 02:29.560
Mom, I'm back.

02:29.640 --> 02:32.880
Yangxi. My dear Yangxi.

02:32.960 --> 02:34.200
- Here.
- Yangxi.

02:36.280 --> 02:38.520
- It's me.
- Yangxi.

02:39.680 --> 02:41.240
Mom, you've traveled far.

02:41.320 --> 02:44.120
Forgive me for not being there.
It's my failure as a son.

02:47.400 --> 02:50.040
Alright, alright. Have a seat.

02:50.120 --> 02:52.240
You're finally reunited.

02:52.920 --> 02:55.120
Wipe those tears away.

02:56.440 --> 02:58.440
I'll have two more dishes made.

02:58.520 --> 03:00.480
Let's celebrate your reunion.

03:00.560 --> 03:02.600
Master Du, before taking her back,

03:02.680 --> 03:03.960
have a meal first.

03:07.200 --> 03:08.440
Thank you for the effort.

03:08.960 --> 03:10.280
It's no trouble, not at all.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.280
Sorry for the trouble.

03:23.720 --> 03:26.240
Mom, how did you come here?

03:26.840 --> 03:29.640
The Liu family wanted to take you
as their son-in-law,

03:29.720 --> 03:31.120
so they got me here by force.

03:31.200 --> 03:34.200
If I didn't meet some kind souls,

03:34.920 --> 03:36.800
I might never have seen you again.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.240
Qiongnu.

03:44.400 --> 03:46.400
- Shouhua?
- The Du family left?

03:47.040 --> 03:49.400
They just left. Do you need something?

03:49.480 --> 03:50.680
After seeing Aunt Du,

03:50.760 --> 03:53.400
Kangning hasn't left her room?

03:57.520 --> 03:59.000
Come here. I need a word with you.

04:10.720 --> 04:11.560
Something happened!

04:12.480 --> 04:13.400
Something happened.

04:13.880 --> 04:15.880
A drunken soldier startled a horse
by Pan Restaurant.

04:15.960 --> 04:18.000
The horse hit Master Chai.

04:18.080 --> 04:19.080
He…

04:33.080 --> 04:34.360
It's so late.

04:34.440 --> 04:36.240
Where are you going?

04:46.480 --> 04:48.280
Seems like

04:48.360 --> 04:49.880
the horse didn't scare Master Chai.

04:49.960 --> 04:51.920
It scared my sister instead.

04:56.760 --> 04:58.080
Shouhua, you lied to me.

04:58.160 --> 05:00.560
You're too clever for that.

05:00.640 --> 05:03.400
How could you believe such a lie?

05:04.520 --> 05:06.480
People watching you two argue

05:06.560 --> 05:09.280
might really think you've both moved on.

05:10.280 --> 05:12.880
How could I know your true feelings
if I didn't test you?

05:12.960 --> 05:15.320
Shouhua, I…

05:24.600 --> 05:25.560
Kangning,

05:26.840 --> 05:29.000
Aunt Du's here.

05:29.920 --> 05:31.320
If you're backing out,

05:32.760 --> 05:34.480
this is your last chance.

05:35.480 --> 05:38.400
From now on, there's no turning back.

05:39.120 --> 05:41.480
Who is the one you care about?

05:41.560 --> 05:43.240
Think carefully about it.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.680
I'll go.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.680
Kangning.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.240
He's waiting outside. Go.

06:44.960 --> 06:46.360
Why are you doing this?

06:50.720 --> 06:53.880
You ruined my marriage,

06:54.400 --> 06:57.160
but I can't block your path?

06:58.200 --> 06:59.680
You're just trying to go against me?

07:01.320 --> 07:04.200
I've paved every step for you

07:04.280 --> 07:05.840
and you really had no idea?

07:08.840 --> 07:10.800
Even a heartless person

07:12.240 --> 07:14.440
should be touched by my sincerity by now.

07:14.520 --> 07:17.440
Why did you conspire with Baniang?

07:17.520 --> 07:20.040
When I found out, I was devastated.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.920
Why didn't you ask me about marriage?

07:25.000 --> 07:27.000
You used force instead.

07:27.080 --> 07:28.600
What did Aunt Du do to you?

07:28.680 --> 07:29.720
Why drag her into it?

07:31.160 --> 07:33.360
If you really wanted to persuade
your mother, couldn't you

07:33.440 --> 07:35.200
try to move her
with rationale and emotions?

07:35.280 --> 07:37.480
You had to lie, trick, and scheme?

07:38.440 --> 07:40.400
Is my family so shameful?

07:40.480 --> 07:43.160
You can fool her for a moment,
but can you fool her forever?

07:43.240 --> 07:45.880
My mom and Madam Li
hold grudges against each other.

07:45.960 --> 07:47.600
It'll take time to mend that.

07:47.680 --> 07:49.440
I'll try to mediate slowly.

07:49.520 --> 07:51.080
But now, you're about to engage.

07:51.160 --> 07:52.640
Did you even leave me any choice?

07:52.720 --> 07:55.440
I didn't want to lie or trick either.

07:55.520 --> 07:56.560
But it's you.

07:57.880 --> 08:00.000
You left me no choice but to scheme.

08:01.040 --> 08:03.440
Why? Does this hurt your pride?

08:06.000 --> 08:07.760
Is she holding a grudge?

08:07.840 --> 08:10.800
Or does she see my family as unworthy?

08:11.480 --> 08:14.360
Master Chai, do you really think

08:15.080 --> 08:16.680
it is only your mom who looks down on me?

08:24.960 --> 08:26.400
Since we're being honest,

08:27.400 --> 08:29.560
there are some harsh things I have to ask,

08:29.640 --> 08:31.400
even if it would make you hate me.

08:32.600 --> 08:34.760
Is your family some noble lineage?

08:34.840 --> 08:36.080
A household of scholars?

08:36.160 --> 08:38.040
Or has your mother never sought
fame and fortune,

08:38.120 --> 08:39.480
connections with the wealthy?

08:40.360 --> 08:42.440
- What?
- If Yuanming weren't a scholar,

08:42.520 --> 08:44.360
would Madam Li even look at him?

08:44.960 --> 08:47.720
People see a servant in your house,

08:47.800 --> 08:49.480
nearly humiliated by a scoundrel.

08:52.080 --> 08:53.680
They talk behind your mother's back

08:53.760 --> 08:55.840
about how she treats her servant.

08:55.920 --> 08:58.680
That gossip reached my mother.
She is, of course, concerned.

08:58.760 --> 09:00.880
Do you expect her

09:00.960 --> 09:02.680
to beg for this marriage?

09:04.160 --> 09:06.520
Is that what you want?

09:16.840 --> 09:18.600
But your family is your family,

09:20.440 --> 09:21.880
and you are you.

09:22.560 --> 09:24.600
I'm marrying you, not your family.

09:25.720 --> 09:27.800
I don't care about these issues.

09:28.840 --> 09:31.640
So, why do you?

09:33.360 --> 09:34.200
Fine words.

09:35.280 --> 09:37.360
You say you don't look down on us,

09:37.440 --> 09:39.000
but you are looking down everywhere.

09:39.960 --> 09:42.880
You love the purity of the lotus flower,

09:42.960 --> 09:45.720
but forget that
it's rooted in the mud below.

09:45.800 --> 09:48.320
Without the mud that loves
and protects it,

09:48.400 --> 09:50.840
it wouldn't survive the rain and wind.

09:52.200 --> 09:54.520
My mother has many flaws,

09:54.600 --> 09:57.000
but she doesn't rob or steal
and only stands on her own feet.

09:57.080 --> 09:58.920
She raised five daughters alone.

09:59.000 --> 10:00.800
To me, she's worth more than gold.

10:00.880 --> 10:02.920
I won't let anyone insult her.

10:03.640 --> 10:05.120
- I…
- Master Chai,

10:05.720 --> 10:07.400
go ahead

10:07.480 --> 10:10.280
and find a bride from the noble families.

10:11.280 --> 10:13.520
Why should I let myself be humiliated?

10:14.160 --> 10:17.280
A simple girl from a small family like me

10:17.360 --> 10:18.600
will settle where I belong.

10:20.240 --> 10:21.440
I swear today,

10:21.520 --> 10:23.840
even if I grow old unmarried,

10:23.920 --> 10:26.640
I'll never set foot in your family!

10:28.280 --> 10:30.040
Kangning. Kangning!

11:39.840 --> 11:40.800
Kangning.

11:44.240 --> 11:46.040
The snow is coming down.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.200
Our lady said,

12:08.280 --> 12:10.480
let's have Master Du
share a room with Sang for a night.

12:10.560 --> 12:12.720
Tomorrow, we'll prepare a proper room.

12:12.800 --> 12:14.360
Aunt Du can move in then.

12:15.800 --> 12:16.680
Thanks.

12:23.680 --> 12:24.720
Mom,

12:25.560 --> 12:28.160
you must be exhausted from the trip.

12:29.000 --> 12:33.080
- Let me prepare a foot soak for you.
- This cotton feels so thick.

12:35.880 --> 12:36.840
Yangxi,

12:38.200 --> 12:39.760
the Li family treats you well.

12:40.520 --> 12:42.280
How will you repay them?

12:46.720 --> 12:47.600
Kneel.

12:56.120 --> 13:01.320
I've heard of many scholars

13:01.400 --> 13:02.800
thinking they're rare treasures,

13:02.880 --> 13:06.120
always trying to push one's luck.

13:06.200 --> 13:08.480
Just waiting to sell themselves high.

13:09.320 --> 13:12.720
I thought, such people
didn't deserve respect.

13:13.320 --> 13:15.880
I taught you to be grateful,

13:15.960 --> 13:17.680
but have you forgotten everything?

13:20.040 --> 13:20.880
Mom,

13:22.120 --> 13:23.160
I get it.

13:24.280 --> 13:27.760
I'll propose marriage tomorrow.

13:31.560 --> 13:32.600
Two bowls, please.

13:32.680 --> 13:33.720
Thanks.

13:33.800 --> 13:36.640
WINTER SOLSTICE

13:36.720 --> 13:38.120
Here you go.

13:38.720 --> 13:39.800
- Okay.
- Thanks.

13:39.880 --> 13:42.040
Here you go. Thank you.
Be careful. It's hot.

13:43.800 --> 13:44.640
Can't catch him.

13:44.720 --> 13:45.800
Got it, got it.

13:45.880 --> 13:47.640
- Got it.
- Slow down.

13:47.720 --> 13:49.560
Toys.

13:49.640 --> 13:51.080
Pinwheel.

13:51.160 --> 13:52.520
Take a look.

13:52.600 --> 13:54.080
Wait for me.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.640
Many thanks, sir.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.640
Cousin,

14:16.720 --> 14:19.080
why turn down

14:19.160 --> 14:20.520
a beauty like that?

14:20.600 --> 14:21.880
Master Fan,

14:21.960 --> 14:24.720
are you scared of your wife's wrath?

14:24.800 --> 14:26.920
Don't be scared.

14:27.000 --> 14:29.400
She naps in the afternoon anyway.

14:29.480 --> 14:30.960
That's right.

14:31.560 --> 14:32.480
Get out.

14:34.400 --> 14:36.200
All of you!

14:37.920 --> 14:38.920
Let's go.

14:47.560 --> 14:50.120
- Chai An!
- I had such a good time.

14:51.080 --> 14:52.400
Why are you ruining it?

14:52.480 --> 14:55.400
My mother-in-law is marrying off
Kangning to Du Yangxi.

14:55.480 --> 14:58.120
Did you hear? Kangning's getting married!

15:01.960 --> 15:03.520
So what?

15:04.320 --> 15:05.960
It has nothing to do with me.

15:07.320 --> 15:10.800
Fine. Guess I shouldn't have meddled.

15:10.880 --> 15:12.200
Not my problem anymore.

15:22.760 --> 15:24.440
Mom, it's the Winter Solstice.

15:24.520 --> 15:27.040
I made new shoes for you. See if they fit.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.840
- Try them on later, okay?
- Sure.

15:28.920 --> 15:29.920
I made some too.

15:30.000 --> 15:30.960
- Mom.
- See. Me too.

15:31.040 --> 15:33.720
- Look at mine.
- I made a peace bracelet.

15:33.800 --> 15:35.400
Here, wear it.

15:35.480 --> 15:36.600
I made it myself.

15:37.200 --> 15:38.560
It means peace and safety.

15:38.640 --> 15:41.120
- Wear it for me, okay?
- Good girl.

15:41.200 --> 15:43.120
Wontons are ready.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.960
Here.

15:47.040 --> 15:48.320
They are colorful.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.120
I want this.

15:50.200 --> 15:51.600
- Here.
- Give me one.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.640
Here.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.200
This looks good.

16:02.920 --> 16:05.560
Mom, did you really agree to the proposal?

16:05.640 --> 16:07.960
Yes, he's a future jinshi.

16:08.040 --> 16:11.320
The Liu family couldn't get such a match.
Of course, I agreed.

16:11.400 --> 16:13.560
Mom settled it with the Du family.

16:13.640 --> 16:15.720
The wedding's after the results
come out in the second month.

16:17.880 --> 16:19.520
Does Kangning want to marry him?

16:22.400 --> 16:23.680
I'll do as Mom says.

16:24.320 --> 16:26.000
That's the spirit.

16:26.080 --> 16:27.520
Eat up.

16:28.440 --> 16:30.440
I got a yellow croaker filling.

16:31.520 --> 16:33.000
- This pink one is…
- Let me try.

16:33.080 --> 16:35.400
Don't eat mine. You have your own.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.960
- Let me try yours.
- I want yellow croaker.

16:38.440 --> 16:40.840
- I want this.
- No.

16:42.680 --> 16:44.160
Is it good?

16:44.240 --> 16:46.840
- Mine's better.
- No, mine's better.

16:46.920 --> 16:48.360
Cousin,

16:48.880 --> 16:50.360
you're trying to marry her.

16:50.440 --> 16:52.440
How could you say something this hurtful?

16:53.240 --> 16:55.040
Kangning was ready to say yes.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.800
If only you said some gentle words,

16:56.880 --> 16:58.960
she'd break the engagement for you.

16:59.040 --> 17:00.480
But your harsh words

17:00.560 --> 17:02.960
made her angry
and she changed her mind again.

17:03.040 --> 17:04.320
Cousin,

17:04.960 --> 17:06.920
you're smart.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.600
How could you mess this up?

17:08.680 --> 17:11.040
Did I not tell the truth?

17:12.320 --> 17:13.480
These days,

17:14.200 --> 17:15.680
I've done so much for her.

17:16.320 --> 17:17.960
She feels that she's shamed,

17:18.760 --> 17:20.840
so she wants to cut ties.

17:21.680 --> 17:23.840
She's so heartless.

17:24.520 --> 17:26.640
Why should I beg her again?

17:27.400 --> 17:28.480
Never.

17:35.960 --> 17:36.920
Cousin,

17:37.640 --> 17:40.400
the Li family isn't like the others.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.000
How are they different?

17:43.000 --> 17:46.000
My mom's a widow too.
She raised her kids with hardship,

17:46.080 --> 17:48.600
but she still values virtue.

17:48.680 --> 17:50.560
Not everyone's like the Li family,

17:50.640 --> 17:52.440
always calculating profits,

17:52.520 --> 17:55.160
teaching their daughters like this,

17:55.240 --> 17:58.000
turning marriage into a deal.

17:59.080 --> 18:01.840
Cousin, this time, you're wrong.

18:03.320 --> 18:04.280
Get in.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.800
She's so young and pretty.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.640
She'll remarry soon, right?

18:10.720 --> 18:11.760
All this property

18:11.840 --> 18:13.280
will be someone else's.

18:13.360 --> 18:14.360
Of course!

18:14.440 --> 18:15.800
All these belong to the Li family.

18:15.880 --> 18:18.200
Move it all out. Don't leave anything.

18:18.280 --> 18:20.720
Take it all.

18:20.800 --> 18:22.080
- Let's move this out.
- Okay.

18:22.160 --> 18:24.000
Move all the stuff. Let's do it.

18:24.080 --> 18:25.080
This one's nice.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.000
You…

18:27.520 --> 18:28.960
Good stuff.

18:29.680 --> 18:31.560
Grab this stuff.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.040
And this.

18:35.120 --> 18:36.440
Take this too.

18:36.520 --> 18:38.000
- Alright.
- And this one.

18:40.280 --> 18:42.360
- That was from my dad!
- Kangning.

18:42.960 --> 18:45.080
Can you even hold onto it?

18:45.160 --> 18:47.320
- I said don't--
- You can't take this.

18:47.400 --> 18:48.920
- Give it back!
- No.

18:51.680 --> 18:52.760
Kid.

18:52.840 --> 18:55.120
You bastard.

18:55.200 --> 18:56.560
- Get up.
- Leave here.

18:57.280 --> 18:59.520
Get out of here.

18:59.600 --> 19:01.320
Robber! Bastard!

19:02.360 --> 19:03.600
You…

19:03.680 --> 19:05.640
Get out!

19:06.240 --> 19:08.800
Out, all of you!

19:08.880 --> 19:09.800
Get out.

19:10.680 --> 19:13.000
I'm telling you,
if you don't give us a hundred or so,

19:13.080 --> 19:14.920
we'll be back tomorrow and the day after.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.240
Can you kill us all?

19:17.320 --> 19:19.240
- Let's go.
- That's right.

19:19.320 --> 19:20.880
Let's go.

19:28.040 --> 19:29.280
It's okay.

19:50.080 --> 19:51.240
This one is for you.

19:51.320 --> 19:52.800
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

19:52.880 --> 19:54.880
- I want one too.
- It's pretty.

19:56.880 --> 19:57.840
I want this.

19:57.920 --> 19:59.680
This is for me.

19:59.760 --> 20:02.200
Stop it. I like that.

20:02.280 --> 20:04.480
Why are you here alone?

20:05.960 --> 20:07.520
This one looks great.

20:08.560 --> 20:09.760
I want that one.

20:09.840 --> 20:11.760
This year, Fuhui is home with us.

20:11.840 --> 20:13.520
- I'll help Mom pick one.
- It's so nice.

20:14.120 --> 20:16.360
When family can gather
and everyone is safe and sound,

20:16.440 --> 20:18.280
that's the happiest life.

20:25.880 --> 20:27.960
Look at you, messy like a kitten.

20:28.720 --> 20:33.360
The late husband's assets go
to his widow and daughter per Song's rule.

20:33.440 --> 20:35.160
Such blatant looting.

20:35.240 --> 20:36.280
No one stopped them?

20:36.360 --> 20:37.600
Of course, there was someone.

20:38.240 --> 20:40.120
The magistrate sentenced them to prison.

20:40.200 --> 20:41.800
Even the neighbors tried to mediate,

20:41.880 --> 20:43.440
but the fights never ended.

20:44.040 --> 20:46.840
While others happily celebrated
Winter Solstice and New Year,

20:46.920 --> 20:50.520
their family feared every festival,
afraid that those bandits would come.

20:51.800 --> 20:55.080
Cousin, if you were Madam Li,

20:55.160 --> 20:57.120
could you have done better?

20:58.480 --> 21:00.800
Why tell me this so late?

21:01.520 --> 21:03.760
Fuhui didn't let me tell you.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.200
Don't blame Kangning.

21:05.880 --> 21:07.640
She's not greedy.

21:08.200 --> 21:09.840
She just wants a peaceful life.

21:11.040 --> 21:13.240
They knew from a young age

21:13.320 --> 21:15.680
that they must stick together

21:15.760 --> 21:17.480
to survive in this world.

21:29.800 --> 21:31.600
Trying to trick your own mother
with outsiders?

21:31.680 --> 21:33.080
Thought you could fool me?

21:33.720 --> 21:34.560
I'm telling you,

21:34.640 --> 21:36.840
I'll never approve of you marrying her.

21:36.920 --> 21:39.080
Mom, Kangning is marrying someone else.

21:39.920 --> 21:42.200
You don't need to worry anymore.

21:44.840 --> 21:47.480
Are you happy now?

21:52.000 --> 21:54.080
Son,

21:54.680 --> 21:56.920
Mom only wants the best for you.

22:05.240 --> 22:08.680
FIRST MONTH IN THE FOLLOWING YEAR

22:55.840 --> 22:57.280
So pretty.

22:58.600 --> 23:00.080
No sneaking bites.

23:00.160 --> 23:02.640
There are so many.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.920
I'll just take one.

23:05.000 --> 23:06.480
This batch wasn't easy to make.

23:06.560 --> 23:08.640
Mom woke me up

23:08.720 --> 23:10.080
before dawn

23:11.600 --> 23:14.400
- just to help her.
- Today's the provincial exam.

23:14.480 --> 23:17.920
Mom says Kangning
must make the cakes herself.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.360
Only then is it sincere,

23:20.680 --> 23:21.640
right?

23:21.720 --> 23:23.200
Deliver them. Hurry up.

23:24.080 --> 23:25.280
Can I see him now?

23:26.800 --> 23:30.040
I know. We're about to be family.

23:30.120 --> 23:33.120
I'm off to deliver this
to my brother-in-law-to-be.

23:36.040 --> 23:37.800
Careful. Don't ruin them.

23:37.880 --> 23:39.720
Don't worry, I won't.

23:44.080 --> 23:44.920
Mom.

23:45.000 --> 23:46.800
Go prepare stuff for the altar.

23:46.880 --> 23:47.960
Hurry.

23:48.040 --> 23:50.800
- Wake up. Let's go.
- Why should it be me again?

23:56.160 --> 24:00.240
EXAM HOUSE

24:24.240 --> 24:26.120
Bless us, Buddha.

24:26.200 --> 24:28.120
Bless my future son-in-law.

24:28.200 --> 24:31.080
Let him pass, achieve glory,

24:31.160 --> 24:33.120
and become a jinshi.

24:33.200 --> 24:35.600
Please.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.560
Kangning,

24:38.640 --> 24:41.640
if Du Yangxi passes,
you'll have to marry him.

24:42.320 --> 24:44.400
With Mom praying so fervently,

24:44.480 --> 24:47.760
are you hoping he passes or not?

25:00.360 --> 25:02.560
The results are out.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.520
The results are out. Let's take a look.

25:07.520 --> 25:08.880
It's too early.

25:09.760 --> 25:10.960
Go back to sleep.

25:11.040 --> 25:12.520
The results are out.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.480
Kangning, let's go.

25:19.560 --> 25:21.000
Let's do the treasure hunt.

25:21.600 --> 25:23.160
The Lantern Festival is over.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.840
Go back to bed.

25:24.920 --> 25:27.920
Today, His Majesty visits Peaks Temple.

25:28.000 --> 25:29.160
He'll return late.

25:29.840 --> 25:31.400
The streets are packed.

25:31.480 --> 25:35.560
Everyone's rushing
to see him at Xuande Gate.

25:37.080 --> 25:38.320
I'm tired.

25:38.840 --> 25:40.200
Kangning.

25:42.360 --> 25:43.440
Please go with us.

25:44.240 --> 25:46.560
It's a once-in-a-lifetime scene.

25:46.640 --> 25:48.720
The best finds are after the crowd clears.

25:49.400 --> 25:51.880
If we don't go now,
the others will take everything.

25:52.800 --> 25:53.720
I'm not going.

25:54.400 --> 25:55.960
- Kangning.
- Bedtime.

25:56.560 --> 25:57.520
Go away.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.280
- Let's go.
- Hey, you.

26:02.360 --> 26:03.360
Let's go.

26:08.280 --> 26:09.680
If you go without me, I'll tell Mom.

26:16.240 --> 26:17.120
Hurry up.

26:22.800 --> 26:25.120
Keep it down,
or Mom won't let anyone leave.

26:29.120 --> 26:30.000
Be quiet.

26:33.360 --> 26:34.280
Take your shoes off.

26:56.520 --> 26:58.160
Kangning, look at this.

26:58.240 --> 26:59.200
What do you think?

27:00.680 --> 27:02.040
It's all trampled.

27:03.560 --> 27:05.400
There's a big one here.

27:05.480 --> 27:07.680
- Take it back for Mom.
- No.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.880
Look at this.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.600
What is it?

27:19.760 --> 27:20.920
Put it on me.

27:25.520 --> 27:27.600
- How is it? Is it pretty?
- It is pretty.

27:31.120 --> 27:32.280
But just only one.

27:44.440 --> 27:45.280
Look at me.

27:45.880 --> 27:46.840
What?

27:51.560 --> 27:53.760
Let's see if there's anything else.

27:56.320 --> 27:57.720
Could it be him?

27:57.800 --> 28:00.560
Kangning, what have you found?

28:02.040 --> 28:04.040
I searched for a long time
and only found this.

28:05.640 --> 28:08.720
- Sisters, come here.
- On my way.

28:08.800 --> 28:10.200
What's this?

28:10.280 --> 28:12.480
A hairpin. It's perfect for Mom.

28:12.560 --> 28:13.920
It's not as good as mine.

28:16.040 --> 28:17.080
What are you looking at?

28:18.680 --> 28:21.840
Nothing. The sun's going to rise soon.

28:21.920 --> 28:24.560
If we don't go back now,
Mom might catch us red-handed.

28:25.360 --> 28:27.520
- Let's go.
- Let's go back.

28:27.600 --> 28:29.720
Let's head back.

28:31.000 --> 28:32.560
Where did this good stuff come from?

28:32.640 --> 28:35.400
Everything we picked up today was good.

29:01.920 --> 29:03.240
Could it be him?

29:09.960 --> 29:10.920
Was it perfectly placed?

29:12.240 --> 29:13.440
Yeah.

29:23.680 --> 29:25.440
- Let me.
- It's okay.

29:25.520 --> 29:27.960
I don't know how many days
I can serve by Mom's side.

29:33.120 --> 29:34.480
Go. Search over there.

29:36.040 --> 29:37.560
What happened? Let's take a look.

29:38.160 --> 29:40.760
Leshan, what's all the excitement about?

29:41.760 --> 29:42.880
Mom.

29:42.960 --> 29:45.040
The palace guards
are out questioning people.

29:45.120 --> 29:47.520
They say Her Majesty's carriage

29:47.600 --> 29:48.640
passed through the street.

29:48.720 --> 29:50.880
Something precious was stolen.
I'll go check.

29:52.040 --> 29:52.920
Leshan, wait for me.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.320
- A treasure?
- I'm waiting.

29:54.400 --> 29:56.000
What kind of treasure?

29:56.080 --> 29:58.760
Check it out and tell me later.
I'll be waiting to hear.

30:08.440 --> 30:10.040
What are you hiding?

30:11.720 --> 30:12.760
Come here.

30:17.880 --> 30:19.200
Such a fine pearl

30:19.880 --> 30:21.320
must not be from an ordinary home.

30:22.400 --> 30:23.480
Could it be from the palace?

30:24.960 --> 30:26.200
Let me hand it over.

30:26.840 --> 30:28.760
Didn't Leshan say?

30:29.440 --> 30:31.440
It's stolen!

30:32.560 --> 30:34.920
If we hand it over now,
we'll be seen as thieves.

30:36.240 --> 30:37.160
We were just hunting.

30:37.240 --> 30:39.240
Whoever sees it gets it.

30:39.320 --> 30:41.040
How did this turn into trouble?

30:41.920 --> 30:43.320
Let's just throw it away.

30:43.400 --> 30:44.800
If someone picks it up unknowingly,

30:44.880 --> 30:46.400
they'll get in trouble. I'll feel bad.

30:48.080 --> 30:50.240
That won't work either.

30:52.200 --> 30:55.040
How about we put it back
and hide nearby to watch?

30:55.640 --> 30:57.960
At dawn, the guards will find it.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.240
It'll go back to its owner.

31:02.480 --> 31:03.640
Okay, that's the way.

31:11.000 --> 31:12.840
Do it now. I'll keep watch for you.

31:22.800 --> 31:24.800
The palace lost the luminous pearl.

31:26.600 --> 31:28.120
Why are you so scared?

31:33.520 --> 31:34.960
It's you. Take it back, quickly.

31:35.720 --> 31:37.120
Don't worry, Kangning.

31:38.480 --> 31:41.640
Remember when we first met?

31:41.720 --> 31:43.080
I broke your comb by mistake.

31:43.840 --> 31:45.560
This is just to make it up to you.

31:47.200 --> 31:50.000
I kept it out of selfishness.

31:50.600 --> 31:52.360
I even had a replica made for you.

31:52.440 --> 31:54.440
I planned to surprise you

31:55.040 --> 31:55.880
when proposing.

32:00.240 --> 32:01.480
I'm not lucky enough

32:02.760 --> 32:04.320
to marry you.

32:05.120 --> 32:08.120
I was foolish

32:08.200 --> 32:09.800
and said things that hurt you.

32:10.400 --> 32:11.880
Please forgive me

32:11.960 --> 32:13.480
for my temper.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.360
With the exam results coming soon,

32:18.360 --> 32:19.640
a wedding is not far off.

32:20.920 --> 32:22.400
I have nothing else for you.

32:27.160 --> 32:30.320
This comb is my wedding gift to you.

32:44.160 --> 32:46.320
Kangning, someone's coming.

32:47.360 --> 32:48.960
The time I miss most

32:50.160 --> 32:52.240
is when we used to argue.

32:53.280 --> 32:54.360
Sadly,

32:55.080 --> 32:56.880
I don't think

32:58.280 --> 32:59.880
I will have the chance again in this life

33:01.760 --> 33:03.360
to be tricked by you again.

33:11.800 --> 33:13.080
Go back now.

33:14.800 --> 33:16.040
Kangning, let's go.

33:30.360 --> 33:31.480
Take it back.

34:06.120 --> 34:08.120
Even if you don't want it,
you shouldn't throw it.

34:08.200 --> 34:10.480
I drew it from memory.
There won't be a second one on earth.

34:16.480 --> 34:18.120
Do you still miss

34:18.200 --> 34:20.280
the days of me tricking you?

34:27.640 --> 34:28.560
Master Chai,

34:29.160 --> 34:31.040
thank you for your kindness,

34:32.360 --> 34:33.600
but I'm getting married.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.560
I can't accept gifts from another man.

34:38.240 --> 34:41.320
Such a treasure. Keep it for yourself.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.920
Give it to your future wife.

34:48.680 --> 34:49.800
Take care.

35:15.080 --> 35:16.240
I don't know this one either.

35:16.320 --> 35:17.400
- Let's go.
- Who passed?

35:17.480 --> 35:18.920
SECOND DAY OF THE SECOND MONTH

35:19.000 --> 35:21.160
Excuse me. Make way.

35:22.440 --> 35:24.320
- I passed!
- There.

35:24.400 --> 35:26.800
- Passed.
- Congrats!

35:26.880 --> 35:28.120
Congrats to you.

35:28.200 --> 35:29.920
Why didn't I make it?

35:31.960 --> 35:33.400
You're looking at it wrong.

35:34.000 --> 35:35.120
That's my name.

35:35.640 --> 35:37.560
I'm on the list too!

35:37.640 --> 35:39.480
- I'm sixth place!
- I passed!

35:39.560 --> 35:41.640
You're the provincial top scorer!

35:41.720 --> 35:43.240
Provincial top scorer!

35:43.320 --> 35:44.360
- Let's go, sir.
- Hurry up.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.480
You're the top one.

35:45.560 --> 35:47.680
- Sir.
- Sir.

35:47.760 --> 35:48.600
- Yuanming.
- Sir.

35:48.680 --> 35:49.960
- Sir, come with us.
- Yuanming.

35:50.040 --> 35:51.400
Yuanming.

35:54.760 --> 35:55.800
Yuanming.

35:55.880 --> 35:57.960
- Sir.
- My husband…

35:58.040 --> 36:00.560
Don't let them go. Take them home.

36:10.040 --> 36:11.040
Wait, no.

36:11.120 --> 36:12.680
I can't remember. Wrong again.

36:13.560 --> 36:14.800
Will anyone even come?

36:15.440 --> 36:18.280
On the second day of the second month,
the roads are packed.

36:19.080 --> 36:21.160
Not everyone goes out.

36:21.840 --> 36:24.080
Come to our place,
guess the names of the wild veggies.

36:24.160 --> 36:26.520
Those who guess it right
can win stationery,

36:26.600 --> 36:28.160
silk, or tea sets as prizes.

36:28.880 --> 36:30.800
If you guess it wrong,
just take it as fun.

36:30.880 --> 36:33.120
Later, we'll hold a veggie-picking feast.

36:33.200 --> 36:36.520
We can sell spring wine too.
To earn a little extra.

36:38.160 --> 36:40.360
Passed! Passed!

36:41.920 --> 36:43.520
What did he win?

36:43.600 --> 36:46.800
He ranked first in the exams!

36:46.880 --> 36:47.920
Provincial top scorer!

36:49.000 --> 36:49.880
What?

36:53.480 --> 36:55.240
Sis,

36:55.320 --> 36:57.840
my son-in-law, your son, ranked first!

36:57.920 --> 37:00.080
Provincial top scorer!

37:00.160 --> 37:01.960
Alright, alright, I heard it.

37:02.040 --> 37:05.160
I know you're happy. I'm thrilled too.

37:05.240 --> 37:06.800
Thank you, Buddha.

37:11.720 --> 37:12.920
Where's Master Du?

37:13.000 --> 37:15.520
I haven't seen him. He's probably hiding.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.240
Hiding?

37:17.320 --> 37:18.520
The wealthy and officials

37:18.600 --> 37:21.040
camped outside the Ministry of Rites
since midnight,

37:21.120 --> 37:24.040
waiting for the results.
It's like a swarm of bees.

37:25.320 --> 37:27.720
It's a crazier scene
than a slaughterhouse.

37:27.800 --> 37:30.320
You fool! Go send someone to fetch him.

37:30.400 --> 37:31.440
Go.

37:31.520 --> 37:33.200
- Go get help from the front shop.
- Okay.

37:34.280 --> 37:37.240
Chunlai, fireworks.

37:37.320 --> 37:39.120
No. I need to save my son-in-law first.

37:40.000 --> 37:40.920
- My son-in-law.
- Mom.

37:42.960 --> 37:45.120
- No rush.
- What--

37:47.760 --> 37:49.080
Oops, spoke too soon.

37:52.200 --> 37:54.120
Sorry, sis.

37:54.200 --> 37:57.480
Seeing him is pure joy.

37:57.560 --> 38:00.120
I didn't think I'd call it too early.

38:00.720 --> 38:04.440
Not early. He's your son-in-law for sure.

38:04.520 --> 38:08.040
Now, we need to plan the wedding fast.

38:08.120 --> 38:11.720
Let's do it. Right away.

38:20.000 --> 38:22.640
Come. Help me decide.

38:23.560 --> 38:25.480
Both of them are great.

38:26.800 --> 38:28.760
She's the daughter of the Court Attendant.

38:28.840 --> 38:31.400
She's 17, writes amazing poetry,

38:31.480 --> 38:33.200
and carries herself with grace.

38:33.280 --> 38:35.160
But her eyes are a bit small.

38:35.240 --> 38:37.800
She's already quite pretty.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.520
Look at this one.

38:39.600 --> 38:42.080
The daughter of the Cavalry Officer.
She's 19.

38:42.160 --> 38:43.760
She's a real beauty.

38:43.840 --> 38:46.120
But sadly, her mother passed early,

38:46.200 --> 38:48.520
and her stepmother may not care much
about her etiquette.

38:48.600 --> 38:49.520
Mom.

38:49.600 --> 38:52.120
Mom, Aunt, there's big news.

38:52.200 --> 38:55.320
Is there anything I haven't faced?

38:55.400 --> 38:58.480
Even within chaos, I stay composed.

38:58.560 --> 39:00.600
Why are you so flustered?

39:00.680 --> 39:03.320
How bad can it be? Look at you.

39:03.920 --> 39:07.200
Aunt, brother is going to sail away.

39:09.560 --> 39:11.880
Congratulations, Madam Li.

39:11.960 --> 39:13.120
Your sharp eye

39:13.200 --> 39:14.560
found a great son-in-law.

39:14.640 --> 39:17.120
This must be destiny.

39:17.200 --> 39:18.320
Congrats.

39:18.920 --> 39:21.240
Congrats.

39:25.120 --> 39:26.800
They're such a perfect match.

39:31.640 --> 39:35.200
Son, where are you sailing to?

39:36.120 --> 39:38.720
Aunt, why not let me finish?

39:38.800 --> 39:40.920
Next month, he's off to Quanzhou.

39:41.000 --> 39:42.560
He'll sail with foreign merchants

39:42.640 --> 39:45.360
to the Arab lands
to sell silk and porcelain.

39:46.680 --> 39:49.160
Son, why leave your big family business

39:49.240 --> 39:50.800
and do business at sea instead?

39:50.880 --> 39:52.080
What do you want?

39:52.160 --> 39:54.680
Aunt, that's not fair to say.

39:54.760 --> 39:56.920
If he brings our Song silk and porcelain

39:57.000 --> 39:58.040
overseas,

39:58.120 --> 39:59.880
he can bring back a lot of frankincense.

39:59.960 --> 40:01.960
It's hugely profitable.

40:02.840 --> 40:04.640
They say the Quanzhou merchants

40:04.720 --> 40:06.680
even harvest oil from stranded whales.

40:06.760 --> 40:08.880
It's a lucrative trade.

40:08.960 --> 40:10.080
It's worth a try.

40:10.160 --> 40:12.080
Though the seas can be rough.

40:12.160 --> 40:14.880
Exactly. Strong winds and waves.

40:14.960 --> 40:18.400
What if the ship capsizes?

40:18.480 --> 40:21.480
Aunt, don't worry too much.

40:21.560 --> 40:23.000
I hear the Quanzhou ships

40:23.080 --> 40:26.480
are as tall as mansions,
with sails towering into the clouds.

40:26.560 --> 40:28.360
They can carry 2,000 bushels of rice.

40:28.440 --> 40:31.720
They are not easy to flip,
unless they hit a major storm.

40:31.800 --> 40:33.440
But who can predict that?

40:33.520 --> 40:36.920
What if he does hit a big storm?

40:37.000 --> 40:38.640
Are you trying to scare me?

40:38.720 --> 40:41.000
Aunt, please don't stress.

40:41.080 --> 40:44.120
You've seen so much in life.

40:44.200 --> 40:47.720
He won't be so unlucky. He'll be fine.

40:47.800 --> 40:49.440
But the Arab lands are far.

40:49.520 --> 40:51.840
Three to five years with no word.

40:51.920 --> 40:53.680
You should be prepared.

40:53.760 --> 40:55.480
Shut up.

40:58.800 --> 41:01.800
You're my only son,

41:03.000 --> 41:05.840
the apple of my eye.

41:05.920 --> 41:07.200
If you leave,

41:07.280 --> 41:10.640
you'll break my heart.

41:11.520 --> 41:14.120
- What day is it today?
- The second day of the second month.

41:16.120 --> 41:17.840
It's the day for the Ministry results.

41:22.920 --> 41:24.840
The second day of the second month.

41:26.520 --> 41:29.120
It should've been my wedding day.

41:30.080 --> 41:31.640
Son, I…

41:52.520 --> 41:54.800
Mom, my trade routes

41:54.880 --> 41:56.760
have covered all of the Song,

41:56.840 --> 41:58.920
but I've never sailed abroad.

42:00.640 --> 42:03.320
I've always heard foreign merchants

42:03.400 --> 42:05.680
talking about Arab lands and Murabit.

42:07.840 --> 42:10.480
This time, I want to see it for myself.

42:11.880 --> 42:13.480
I promise you,

42:13.560 --> 42:15.160
I'll return safely

42:15.920 --> 42:17.080
as soon as possible.

42:17.960 --> 42:19.120
Don't worry about me.

42:19.960 --> 42:21.600
Take care of yourself.

42:22.560 --> 42:23.760
I leave the day after tomorrow.

42:24.680 --> 42:26.480
I still have many things to arrange.

42:27.360 --> 42:28.200
I'll head off now.

42:31.120 --> 42:32.120
Cousin.

42:36.960 --> 42:38.080
Aunt.

42:38.160 --> 42:40.600
He's made up his mind.

42:40.680 --> 42:41.760
No one can stop him.

42:42.760 --> 42:45.320
You probably should accept it.

42:45.920 --> 42:47.160
Go, prepare a generous gift.

42:47.240 --> 42:49.360
I'm heading to the Li family.

42:52.320 --> 42:54.840
Both families agreed on this match.

42:55.640 --> 42:57.760
The betrothal letter was exchanged,

42:57.840 --> 43:00.240
and by rule, this marriage
should have been agreed upon.

43:01.400 --> 43:03.880
But the Matchmaking God

43:03.960 --> 43:05.160
forgot the red string.

43:05.840 --> 43:08.680
A few words from us have ruined it.

43:10.280 --> 43:14.160
Madam Chai, so it's just a few words?

43:15.120 --> 43:16.760
It's my fault, all my fault.

43:17.600 --> 43:20.040
I listened to nonsense gossip
and didn't think it through.

43:20.120 --> 43:24.320
I've wronged our good in-laws.

43:24.400 --> 43:28.000
Today, I came to apologize.

43:28.080 --> 43:29.720
My dear in-law,

43:29.800 --> 43:32.960
you're so kind and forgiving.
Please forgive me.

43:34.120 --> 43:35.680
Don't let my foolishness

43:35.760 --> 43:38.440
ruin a heaven-sent match.

43:38.520 --> 43:39.960
Oh no, don't say that.

43:40.040 --> 43:42.360
I'm just a humble tea seller.

43:42.440 --> 43:45.480
I can't be compared
to the prestigious Chai family.

43:45.560 --> 43:47.360
Being your in-law

43:47.440 --> 43:48.960
is out of my league.

43:50.400 --> 43:51.320
But, you know,

43:51.400 --> 43:55.080
even poor families are blessed by heaven.

43:55.160 --> 43:58.560
See those people lining up outside
with their betrothal letters?

43:58.640 --> 44:02.400
They're here to meet
the new provincial top scorer.

44:02.480 --> 44:03.520
Do you know what it is?

44:03.600 --> 44:06.760
The top scorer in the civil exams.

44:07.640 --> 44:10.600
In the capital, where riches abound,

44:10.680 --> 44:14.040
a top scorer is one in a million.

44:15.320 --> 44:18.400
A talent like that

44:18.480 --> 44:20.680
could marry into any noble family.

44:20.760 --> 44:22.160
Am I right?

44:23.160 --> 44:26.200
And yet he chose Kangning
for her character and looks.

44:26.280 --> 44:29.120
He can't wait to marry into our family.

44:29.200 --> 44:32.720
This is far better than peeking
at someone through a crack in the door.

44:33.320 --> 44:35.640
- Right?
- You're right.

44:36.240 --> 44:38.360
I was blind and arrogant.

44:38.440 --> 44:39.560
I offended you.

44:40.200 --> 44:42.840
I deeply regret my actions.

44:49.280 --> 44:52.000
But you've burnt the bridge.

44:52.080 --> 44:54.040
How can there be a way back?

44:54.120 --> 44:56.280
Don't bow to me.

44:56.360 --> 44:58.560
Even if you kneel down, I can't--

44:59.880 --> 45:00.720
Don't do this.

45:00.800 --> 45:02.080
If kneeling could make you agree,

45:02.160 --> 45:03.760
I'd do it.

45:06.240 --> 45:09.240
You should've thought of this sooner.

45:10.080 --> 45:11.040
In-law,

45:11.120 --> 45:13.360
breaking the engagement was my idea.

45:13.440 --> 45:15.120
My son didn't want to break it at all.

45:15.200 --> 45:17.920
When he heard
she was promised to someone else,

45:18.000 --> 45:21.040
he was so heartbroken
that he decided to sail away.

45:22.360 --> 45:23.600
Please.

45:23.680 --> 45:26.160
We're both widowed at a young age.

45:26.240 --> 45:28.520
You have five daughters to rely on,

45:28.600 --> 45:30.960
but I only have this one son.

45:31.040 --> 45:34.240
If you save him, you save my whole family.

45:36.960 --> 45:38.200
Madam,

45:38.760 --> 45:39.920
someone from the Du family

45:40.000 --> 45:42.080
is here to discuss the betrothal.

45:46.320 --> 45:47.440
Madam Chai,

45:47.520 --> 45:49.920
it's not that I don't want to,

45:50.680 --> 45:53.120
but I only have one Kangning,

45:53.200 --> 45:55.240
and she's already promised
to the Du family.

45:55.320 --> 45:58.280
The formal betrothal is in three days.

45:58.880 --> 46:02.480
There's no turning back.

46:02.560 --> 46:04.320
- Please leave.
- I…

46:05.440 --> 46:06.480
Please just go.

46:17.160 --> 46:18.320
After I leave,

46:18.400 --> 46:20.440
keep feeding it this top-quality hay.

46:20.520 --> 46:22.720
Pick fresh, leafy ones for it.

46:23.280 --> 46:26.120
It's impatient, so go easy on the oats.

46:26.200 --> 46:28.280
- Don't let it feel wronged.
- Understood.

46:28.360 --> 46:30.920
Cousin! Cousin!

46:31.920 --> 46:34.280
Are you really leaving?

46:35.200 --> 46:38.280
Kangning hasn't had the wedding yet.

46:38.360 --> 46:39.680
So, she hasn't married yet.

46:41.080 --> 46:42.080
Go talk to her.

46:42.160 --> 46:44.920
All that "men don't kneel" talk.
It's just for show.

46:45.000 --> 46:46.960
At home, we kneel
to heaven, earth, and parents.

46:47.040 --> 46:50.000
One more kneel for a beauty will break it?

46:50.080 --> 46:51.120
Proves they're fragile.

46:51.200 --> 46:53.320
Kangning got a good match.

46:53.400 --> 46:55.000
We should be happy for her.

46:55.080 --> 46:57.040
I won't go,
and you better not make trouble.

46:57.640 --> 46:59.080
Enough. I'm busy.

46:59.160 --> 47:00.800
Leave me alone.

47:00.880 --> 47:02.640
Go tell my mother I'm doing fine.

47:02.720 --> 47:04.280
Cousin.

47:06.440 --> 47:08.280
You're so noble and generous,

47:08.360 --> 47:09.520
handing over a good woman.

47:09.600 --> 47:11.680
Let's see if you'll regret it.

47:17.680 --> 47:19.080
Looks just like its owner.

47:20.640 --> 47:21.960
Master Fan.

47:23.400 --> 47:25.840
Master Fan, the mistress is calling.

49:54.760 --> 49:57.120
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
